WEBVTT

00:01:59.413 --> 00:02:02.204
the better the algorithm becomes
at identifying new images.

00:02:02.246 --> 00:02:03.871
This is similar to our own brains,

00:02:03.913 --> 00:02:09.038
which learn from previous experiences
to shape how new stimuli are processed.

00:02:09.079 --> 00:02:13.204
Recognition algorithms aren't just
limited to facial expressions.

00:02:13.288 --> 00:02:16.163
Our emotions manifest in many ways.

00:02:16.204 --> 00:02:18.913
There are body language and vocal tone,

00:02:18.954 --> 00:02:22.496
changes in heart rate, complexion,
and skin temperature,

00:02:22.538 --> 00:02:27.038
or even word frequency
and sentence structure in our writing.

